NAME: unary condition on an A-field variable
DESCRIPTION: JZ x with x stored in an A-field tests that field (.A); fixed in i-7d2612-3744e5, see behtests/cond1_afield.beh
SRC:
(let (x 0)
  (seq
    (JMP (Dir 2))
    (DAT (store x) 5)
    (if (JZ x)
      (JMP (Dir 0))) ))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  JMP    $2     , #0     
LET1  
  DAT    #0     , #5     
  JMN.A  $IF8   , $LET1  
  JMP    $0     , #0     
IF8   
  DAT    #0     , #0     